namespace FlexFlow {
/**

\page testing Testing

FlexFlow Train's test suite is written using the <a href="https://github.com/doctest/doctest">doctest</a> framework.
Tests are located in the <tt>test/</tt> subdirectory of each of the libraries, and
tests are always placed in a file whose path matches that of the header and source files.
For example, all of the tests for \ref compiler are found under the <tt>lib/compiler/test/</tt> directory.
The tests for a single header in compiler, for example <tt>lib/compiler/include/compiler/machine_mapping/machine_view.h</tt>,
are located in <tt>lib/compiler/test/src/compiler/machine_mapping/machine_view.h</tt>.

*/
}
